  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759262,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 102 Dalmatians: Puppies to the Rescue (Game Boy Color) - Synopsis\n\nEmbark on a charming platform adventure in *102 Dalmatians: Puppies to the Rescue* for Game Boy Color! When Cruella de Vil's toy sales plummet, she devises a dastardly plan: reprogram her toys to capture pets and freeze them into \"Super-Gloop\" for a new line of realistic toys. While their parents, Dipstick and Dottie, bravely venture out to rescue their captured puppies, young Oddball and Domino are left behind. Determined to save their family, the resourceful duo sets off on a quest across London, England, navigating vibrant levels inspired by iconic landmarks like Regent’s Park and Big Ben.\n\nCollect stickers to fill a virtual sticker book, solving puzzles, rescuing puppies, and completing chores along the way.  Utilize unique abilities like tumbling to break crates and short-circuiting enemy toys.  With sharp, clean graphics and a captivating storyline, *102 Dalmatians* delivers a delightful and engaging experience perfect for young adventurers. Can Oddball and Domino save their family before Cruella’s scheme is complete?"
    },
